  "body": "School-day convenience meets an easy coastal lifestyle in this near-new standalone home. With four bedrooms, modern interiors and manageable outdoor space, it's an appealing choice for families wanting more time to enjoy life.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen, dining and living areas come together in a sociable open-plan layout, keeping everyone connected while cooking, entertaining or relaxing. A private courtyard extends your living outdoors without the upkeep of a large garden.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms upstairs provide flexibility for family, guests or working from home. The master enjoys its own ensuite, while a family bathroom and additional guest toilet add everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll appreciate:\r\n* Four bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms \r\n* an internal-access garage.\r\n* Contemporary kitchen with quality appliances\r\n* Air conditioning for year-round comfort\r\n* Easy-care courtyard\r\n* Balance of a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nWith Rangitoto College across the road, Murrays Bay School a short walk away, and reserves, beaches and local amenities nearby, this location brings education and recreation together.\r\n\r\nMake your move to Murrays Bay. Contact Linda Ke for more information or to arrange a viewing.",
